  "description": "Warrior is a full suspension electric mountain bike with a 1000W Bafang motor, 26 × 4-inch fat tires and a 48V 20Ah LG-cell battery. Choose cadence-based assist on Warrior or torque-sensing assist on Warrior Pro for everyday trips and recreational off-road riding. Both versions offer five assist levels, a thumb throttle, Shimano 7-speed gearing and Logan hydraulic disc brakes. The front suspension fork and rear shock work together on pavement, gravel and recreational trail rides. 1000W Bafang geared hub motor; published peak power 1270W. Warrior: cadence sensor. Warrior Pro: torque sensor. 48V 20Ah (960Wh) battery with LG cells. Full suspension: 100 mm front / 50 mm rear. 26 × 4-inch Kenda fat tires; 350 lb total payload. Recommended rider height 5'4\" and above. Published range highlight: up to 80 miles. See the riding range table for assist-level estimates and reference conditions; actual range varies with riding conditions.",
